  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Income &amp; Jobs &amp; Gender</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Income, Jobs &amp; Gender team drives IDH&apos;s outcome on responsible and equitable business and transformed global value chains. It works with companies across sectors to redesign procurement, sourcing, and trading practices so that value is more fairly distributed to farmers and workers, including through living income and living wage approaches. It promotes gender-transformative business models that address root causes of gender inequality and supports companies in building long-term, transparent supplier relationships and more inclusive employment practices across global agricultural value chains</narrative>
  </description>
